      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Scaling has always been a massive annoyance for me when it comes to public avatars especially, I'll find a nice avatar and it's practically unusable because it's ridiculously too small or too big for me. It's not like I could fix the scale myself either.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
