      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "In addition, in terms of 'size griefing', this is something that could be mitigated a couple of ways. For example, it could be world limited, world builders could have the option to set a max size though some may dislike this if they do something such as enforce human sizes only for people who prefer being just a bit bigger.\nAlternatively, an optional safety setting could exist to let you set a max size cap and prevent people from getting above a certain size locally on your client.\nI'm uncertain if a similar minimum size option would be desired.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
