      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Would love this, I have to deal with uploading 3 different versions of the same avi to cater to either the friend group I was with or what kind of mood I was in. Resizing or at least being able to animate you viewpoint/colliders would be so, so nice.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
